    "answerHtml": "<ul>\n<li>Overloading = compile-time (static) polymorphism, same name different parameter list, resolved by the compiler using the <em>reference/declared</em> type. Return type alone is not enough.</li>\n<li>Overriding = runtime (dynamic) polymorphism, same signature in a subclass, resolved via the vtable at runtime using the <em>actual object</em> type. Rules: same or covariant return type, cannot reduce visibility, cannot throw broader <em>checked</em> exceptions, <code>static</code>/<code>private</code>/<code>final</code> methods cannot be overridden (static gets <em>hidden</em>).</li>\n</ul>",
