    "prompt": "== vs equals for Strings, and the String pool.",
    "answerHtml": "<p><code>==</code> compares references; <code>equals</code> compares content. String literals are interned in the string pool (in heap since Java 7); <code>new String(\"a\")</code> creates a distinct heap object. <code>.intern()</code> pushes it into the pool.</p><div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"java\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"java\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\">              </span><span class=\"c1\">// a == b  → true (pool)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"java\"</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"w\">              </span><span class=\"c1\">// a == c  → false</span>\n<span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">intern</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"w\">                      </span><span class=\"c1\">// a == d  → true</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
