    "answerHtml": "<p>Shallow copies the reference fields (both objects share the inner objects); deep clones nested objects too. Implement deep copy via copy constructor, serialization round-trip, or a mapping library. <code>Object.clone()</code> is shallow and generally discouraged.</p>",
