    "prompt": "Walk me through your CI/CD pipeline.",
    "answerHtml": "<p class=\"tldr\"><strong>In one line</strong> — a declarative <code>Jenkinsfile</code> in the repo, triggered on PR and merge, promoting one artifact through environments.</p><ol>\n<li>Checkout → build and unit test</li>\n<li>Static analysis: SonarQube quality gate + coverage threshold</li>\n<li>Dependency vulnerability scan</li>\n<li>Integration tests with Testcontainers</li>\n<li>Build and push image, tagged with the commit SHA</li>\n<li>Deploy to dev → smoke tests → staging → manual approval → production (rolling or canary)</li>\n</ol><p class=\"bonus\"><strong>Say this too</strong> — secrets from the credentials store or Vault, never the Jenkinsfile. The <strong>same artifact is promoted</strong> rather than rebuilt per environment. Rollback is <code>helm rollback</code>.</p>",
