    "answerHtml": "<p class=\"tldr\"><strong>In one line</strong> — a multi-stage Dockerfile — a build stage with the JDK, then a slim JRE runtime stage that copies only the jar.</p><ul>\n<li>Cache dependencies in their own layer; order layers by change frequency</li>\n<li>Non-root user, <code>.dockerignore</code>, pinned base image versions</li>\n</ul><p class=\"gotcha\"><strong>Gotcha</strong> — use <code>-XX:MaxRAMPercentage</code>, not <code>-Xmx</code>. Heap should scale with the container limit instead of being hardcoded.</p>",
