    "part": 11,
    "prompt": "Explain the architecture of your current project.",
    "answerHtml": "<p>There's no generic answer — this is the one you must build yourself, and it's reported as the opener of the techno-managerial round. Use the four-move structure in Part 09 §2, be able to <strong>draw it from memory</strong>, and for every box on the diagram be ready for \"how does that actually work internally\". Part 10 §13 lists the five follow-ups to rehearse per component.</p>",
