    "part": 11,
    "prompt": "Tell me about two challenging features you implemented or fixed.",
    "answerHtml": "<p>Reported verbatim as a prompt. Prepare two, each about 90 seconds: the constraint that made it hard, the options you weighed, what you chose and what you gave up, and the measured outcome. One should be a performance or correctness problem with before-and-after numbers; the other should involve a design decision where reasonable people could have disagreed.</p>",
