    "prompt": "Count character / word frequency (the Java 8 streams version).",
    "answerHtml": "<pre><code>Map&lt;Character, Long&gt; freq = s.chars()\n    .mapToObj(c -&gt; (char) c)\n    .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(c -&gt; c, Collectors.counting()));\n\n// Most frequent word in a sentence\nString top = Arrays.stream(text.toLowerCase().split(\"\\\\W+\"))\n    .filter(w -&gt; !w.isBlank())\n    .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(w -&gt; w, Collectors.counting()))\n    .entrySet().stream()\n    .max(Map.Entry.comparingByValue())\n    .map(Map.Entry::getKey).orElse(\"\");\n</code></pre>\n<p class=\"gotcha\">Expect \"now do it without streams\" — they're checking you didn't only memorise the idiom. Have the loop version ready too. Part 08 has the full <code>Collectors</code> catalogue if you want to revise downstream collectors tonight.</p>",
